[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://edge_csg_invalid_size"]

; A zero-volume CSGBox3D size. `Vector3(0, 0, 0)` passes format validation (no
; min/max on size's components) and produces a degenerate BoxGeometry, so this
; pins that the renderer survives a zero-size mesh. Godot does not clamp `size`
; and builds the brush with 12 faces regardless, so the scene lints clean.

